sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant M as Menu page
    participant A as App state
    participant K as Cart page
    participant O as My Orders
    participant AD as Admin
    C->>M: Search and filter
    C->>M: Add to Cart
    M->>A: addToCart(item)
    C->>K: Choose pickup or delivery
    K->>A: placeOrder(type, address)
    A-->>A: save to localStorage
    A->>O: order shows as Pending
    AD->>A: updateOrderStatus(id, status)
    A->>O: status updates
